          "_name": "article11",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article11\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n       <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">        \n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mt-0 mb-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Nitric Boost Ultra™ | Official Site</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">The Genius Switch operates through a science-informed technique known as brainwave entrainment. This method uses precisely calibrated sound frequencies that interact with your brain’s natural electrical patterns. When you listen, your brain begins to synchronize with these frequencies — a process that gently guides your mind into more optimal mental states.<div><br></div><div>Most people spend their day operating in high-frequency beta brainwave states. While useful for problem-solving and daily tasks, prolonged beta dominance can contribute to stress, overthinking, and mental fatigue. The Genius Switch helps transition your brain toward slower, more restorative states such as alpha, theta, and delta — brainwave patterns commonly linked to relaxation, creativity, deep focus, and intuitive insight.</div><div><br></div><div>As the audio flows through your auditory system, it influences neural activity in a subtle yet measurable way. This encourages the brain to form more balanced and efficient neural pathways. Over time, consistent listening may support improved clarity, decision-making, and emotional regulation.</div><div><br></div><div>One of the key strengths of The Genius Switch is its simplicity. There’s no need for prior meditation experience, mental training, or effortful concentration. Listening alone is enough to initiate the synchronization process. The brain naturally adapts to the sound patterns, optimizing its internal rhythms without conscious strain.</div><div><br></div><div>Rather than overwhelming you with information or demanding constant engagement, the program works quietly in the background. With repeated use, many individuals report noticing gradual improvements in focus, confidence, creative thinking, and overall mental ease.</div><div><br></div><div>The Genius Switch doesn’t add anything artificial to your system — it supports your brain in returning to a more balanced, high-functioning state that may have been temporarily suppressed by stress or overstimulation.</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Learn more\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
