          "_name": "article17",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#061b4a\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Integrating The Genius Switch into your routine is simple. With consistent use and the right environment, you can create the ideal conditions for better focus, creativity, and mental balance.</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ol>\n            <li><b>Choose a Quiet Environment :</b>&nbsp;Select a calm, distraction-free space where you can listen comfortably. A peaceful setting allows your mind to settle and helps you fully engage with the audio experience without interruptions.</li>\n            <li><b>Listen for 10–15 Minutes Daily :</b>&nbsp;Consistency matters more than duration. Set aside just 10 to 15 minutes each day to listen. You can use it in the morning to start your day with clarity, during a midday break to reset your focus, or before bed to unwind.</li>\n            <li><b>Use Headphones for Best Results :</b>&nbsp;For optimal performance, listen with quality headphones. Since the program uses layered audio frequencies designed to interact with your brain’s natural rhythms, headphones help deliver the full stereo effect as intended.</li>\n            <li><b>Make It Part of Your Routine :</b>&nbsp;Turn it into a daily habit. Whether you prefer mornings or evenings, sticking to a regular schedule helps reinforce the mental patterns the program is designed to support.</li>\n            <li><b>Stay Relaxed and Open :</b>&nbsp;While listening, allow yourself to relax. There’s no need to force concentration or expect instant changes. Approach each session with an open mind and let the process unfold naturally over time.</li><li><b>Observe and Reflect on Changes :</b>&nbsp;Pay attention to subtle shifts in your focus, mood, creativity, or decision-making. Keeping brief notes about your experiences can help you recognize improvements and stay motivated.</li><li><b>Pair with Positive Habits :</b>&nbsp;To deepen the impact, consider combining The Genius Switch with supportive practices like journaling, visualization, breathwork, or mindfulness exercises. These habits can reinforce clarity and help you apply insights more effectively in daily life.</li>\n          </ol>\n          <ol>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
