          "_name": "article17",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#061b4a\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">The Genius Switch offers a range of potential benefits for mental performance and overall well-being.</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ol>\n            <li><b>Improved Mental Clarity and Focus :</b>&nbsp;The program’s audio patterns are designed to encourage brain states associated with calm concentration. This can be particularly helpful for individuals who struggle with distractions, overthinking, or mental fog. By promoting clearer thought patterns, it may support greater productivity and precision in daily tasks.</li>\n            <li><b>Enhanced Creativity and Idea Flow :</b>&nbsp;By guiding the brain into states linked with imagination and intuitive thinking, The Genius Switch may help unlock new perspectives and insights. This makes it especially useful for creatives, entrepreneurs, writers, and problem-solvers seeking fresh ideas and innovative solutions.</li>\n            <li><b>Stress Support and Relaxation :</b>&nbsp;Chronic stress can interfere with focus, memory, and decision-making. The Genius Switch encourages slower brainwave patterns often associated with relaxation and balance. A calmer mental state can contribute to improved emotional regulation and overall well-being.</li>\n            <li><b>Increased Confidence and Motivation :</b>&nbsp;As mental clarity improves and internal resistance decreases, it often becomes easier to take action. The program may help reduce hesitation and mental clutter, supporting more confident decisions and forward momentum toward personal or professional goals.</li>\n            <li><b>Stronger Problem-Solving Ability :</b>&nbsp;When your mind is calm and focused, you’re better able to evaluate challenges objectively. The Genius Switch may help you approach problems from new angles, increasing your ability to find practical and creative solutions.</li>\n          </ol>\n          <ol>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
