          "_name": "article17",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b7b3ef\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">The Wealth Signal™ is designed as a simple daily mindset routine. While individual results may vary, the following practices can help you engage with the program more effectively and consistently:</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>The Genius Switch is designed to support sharper thinking, stronger focus, and improved mental balance by guiding your brain into more productive patterns. Using carefully structured audio frequencies, the program encourages your mind to enter states commonly associated with calm awareness, creativity, and deep concentration.<div><br></div><div>When your brain operates in balanced states such as alpha and theta, it becomes easier to think clearly, generate ideas, and make thoughtful decisions. Instead of feeling scattered or mentally drained, you may notice a smoother, more organized flow of thoughts. This can support faster problem-solving, improved concentration, and better overall cognitive performance.</div><div><br></div><div>If you experience mental blocks, difficulty focusing, or low motivation, The Genius Switch works by helping your brain shift away from stress-driven patterns. Over time, consistent listening may encourage neuroplasticity — the brain’s natural ability to adapt and form new neural connections. This can make it easier to develop healthier thinking habits and more productive mental routines.</div><div><br></div><div>The program may also help you access “flow states” more naturally — those moments when you feel fully immersed, creative, and engaged in what you’re doing. Whether you’re working on personal goals, business projects, or creative pursuits, this improved mental alignment can enhance both efficiency and inspiration.</div><div><br></div><div>In addition, The Genius Switch supports relaxation by guiding the brain toward calmer rhythms. When stress levels decrease, clarity often increases. A relaxed mind is typically better equipped to evaluate situations objectively, respond thoughtfully, and make confident choices.</div><div><br></div><div>At its core, The Genius Switch is about helping you reconnect with your natural mental capabilities — supporting clearer thinking, greater creativity, and more confident decision-making.</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
