          "_name": "article17",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#061b4a\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">The Genius Switch is designed for anyone who wants to enhance mental clarity, creativity, and focus. While it can support a wide range of individuals, the following groups may find it especially valuable:</h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ol>\n            <li><b>Creative Professionals :</b>&nbsp;Artists, writers, designers, musicians, and content creators often face creative blocks or idea fatigue. The Genius Switch may help encourage fresh thinking, improve idea flow, and support problem-solving from new perspectives.</li>\n            <li><b>Entrepreneurs and Business Leaders :</b>&nbsp;Business owners and entrepreneurs regularly make high-level decisions under pressure. By promoting clearer thinking and sustained focus, the program may help support strategic planning, productivity, and long-term goal alignment.</li>\n            <li><b>Students and Lifelong Learners :</b>&nbsp;Whether preparing for exams, studying complex material, or learning new skills, students may benefit from improved concentration and mental organization. The Genius Switch is designed to support focus and cognitive balance during learning activities.</li>\n            <li><b>Individuals Focused on Personal Development :</b>&nbsp;Those seeking greater self-awareness, mental clarity, or intuitive insight may find the program helpful as part of their personal growth journey. It can complement existing self-improvement practices by supporting a calm and focused mental state.</li>\n            <li><b>People Experiencing Mental Blocks :</b>&nbsp;If you’ve been feeling stuck, indecisive, or creatively drained, The Genius Switch may help you shift out of repetitive thought patterns and regain a sense of clarity and forward momentum.</li><li><b>Professionals in High-Stress Environments :</b>&nbsp;Healthcare workers, finance professionals, tech specialists, executives, and others in demanding roles often experience mental fatigue. The program may assist in promoting calm focus and emotional balance during high-pressure situations.</li><li><b>Mindfulness and Meditation Practitioners :</b>&nbsp;If you already practice mindfulness, journaling, or meditation, The Genius Switch can serve as a supportive addition. It may help you enter relaxed, aware states more easily and deepen your overall mental clarity.</li>\n          </ol>\n          <ol>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article17-4h",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vce5Vf08Kk",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
